<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:52:31 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>计算机科学需要计算机吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/does-computer-science-need-computers</link><description>该领域的理论方面不需要计算机。但如果没有它们，许多问题就不会被提出。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/does-computer-science-need-computers.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:52:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/does-computer-science-need-computers</guid></item><item><title>氨基酸代谢重新布线导致前列腺癌激素治疗耐药</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/amino-acid-metabolism-rewiring-leads-to-hormone-therapy-resistance-in-prostate-cancer</link><description>一项新的研究表明，前列腺肿瘤可以重新连接氨基酸代谢，以克服胆固醇产生的正常抑制，这一过程可能会加剧激素治疗的耐药性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/amino-acid-metabolism-rewiring-leads-to-hormone-therapy-resistance-in-prostate-cancer2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:37:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/amino-acid-metabolism-rewiring-leads-to-hormone-therapy-resistance-in-prostate-cancer</guid></item><item><title>TRANQUILITY：使用 Pacibekitug 持续降低 CKD 患者的炎症标志物</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/tranquility-sustained-reductions-in-inflammatory-markers-in-ckd-patients-with-pacibekitug</link><description>Pacibekitug 是一种针对白细胞介素 6 的新型长效单克隆抗体，根据研究结果，可持续降低慢性肾病 (CKD) 和高炎症风险患者的炎症标志物，但尚未发现明确的剂量相关安全信号。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tranquility-sustained-reductions-in-inflammatory-markers-in-ckd-patients-with-pacibekitug.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:22:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/tranquility-sustained-reductions-in-inflammatory-markers-in-ckd-patients-with-pacibekitug</guid></item><item><title>REACT：利用成像技术检测成年早期的无症状动脉粥样硬化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/react-use-of-imaging-to-detect-silent-atherosclerosis-in-early-adulthood</link><description>根据成年早期的影像学检查，无症状动脉粥样硬化是可以检测到的，根据研究结果，动脉区域的患病率与年龄和性别相关，斑块体积显着增加。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/react-use-of-imaging-to-detect-silent-atherosclerosis-in-early-adulthood.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:07:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/react-use-of-imaging-to-detect-silent-atherosclerosis-in-early-adulthood</guid></item><item><title>钻石时钟结合两个信号来减少温度驱动的漂移</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/diamond-clock-combines-two-signals-to-cut-temperature-driven-drift</link><description>尽管有很多关于订婚戒指和项链礼物的广告，但天然钻石并不完美。它们的碳原子排列成立方晶格，但由于偶尔取代碳原子的杂质，它们仍然含有几种类型的晶体缺陷。最常见的杂质类型是氮和硼； “I 型”钻石含有氮杂质，这些杂质可以分离或聚集，浓度高达 1%，约占所有天然钻石的 95%。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/diamond-clock-combines-two-signals-to-cut-temperature-driven-drift2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:52:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/diamond-clock-combines-two-signals-to-cut-temperature-driven-drift</guid></item><item><title>新型晶体管将高电压提升至微芯片规模</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-transistor-brings-high-voltage-to-microchip-scale</link><description>在每个电子设备内部，电流都是由称为晶体管的开关控制的。几十年来，这些开关都是由硅制成的。最近，工程师们转向了一种名为氮化镓 (GaN) 的材料，这种材料可以实现智能手机充电器等小型高效设备。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-transistor-brings-high-voltage-to-microchip-scale2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:37:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-transistor-brings-high-voltage-to-microchip-scale</guid></item><item><title>磁存储器可以使边缘人工智能更快，同时减少能源消耗</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/magnetic-memory-could-make-edge-ai-faster-while-reducing-energy-use</link><description>德克萨斯州的工程师与世界上最大的半导体代工厂合作，制造和测试一种新兴的存储技术，该技术可以帮助满足人工智能日益增长的能源需求。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/magnetic-memory-could-make-edge-ai-faster-while-reducing-energy-use2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:22:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/magnetic-memory-could-make-edge-ai-faster-while-reducing-energy-use</guid></item><item><title>类似谷歌的单细胞 RNA 数据搜索引擎可以回答以前不可能的问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-google-like-search-engine-for-single-cell-rna-data-could-answer-previously-impossible-questions</link><description>想象一下，医生可以准确地了解哪些细胞导致了患者的癌症，或者病原体是否导致了这种疾病。然后他们可以使用这些信息来针对患者的特定癌症制定治疗计划。但回答这些问题意味着需要费力地查阅全球海量数据库中数千个实验的数据。而且，搜寻至少需要几天时间。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-google-like-search-engine-for-single-cell-rna-data-could-answer-previously-impossible-questions3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:07:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-google-like-search-engine-for-single-cell-rna-data-could-answer-previously-impossible-questions</guid></item><item><title>纳米天线使活细胞发光更亮、更快</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nano-antennas-make-living-cells-light-up-brighter-and-faster</link><description>代尔夫特理工大学的研究人员首次证明，纳米天线可以增强活体人类和其他哺乳动物细胞中蛋白质的荧光。科学家们已经使用了智能荧光蛋白，当神经细胞上的电压发生变化时，它们就会发光。通过将纳米天线靠近这些发光蛋白质，研究人员可以更精确地监测细胞内部的过程。这一发现增加了一种通过纳米技术和基因工程揭示大脑电信号的新工具。该研究发表于&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nano-antennas-make-living-cells-light-up-brighter-and-faster.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:52:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nano-antennas-make-living-cells-light-up-brighter-and-faster</guid></item><item><title>量子模拟器对已有 40 年历史的物理理论进行了检验</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/quantum-simulators-put-a-40-year-old-physics-theory-to-the-test</link><description>物理学家使用先进的量子技术来测试几十年前理论的预测。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/quantum-simulators-put-a-40-year-old-physics-theory-to-the-test2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:37:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/quantum-simulators-put-a-40-year-old-physics-theory-to-the-test</guid></item></channel></rss>